{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "context": "advised", "date_basis": "source", "external_id": "s46", "external_status": "not_checked", "id": "youtube-shorts-run-transcripts-s46-yaml-bf8acc0e1a:c001:e001:b63b254c", "kind": "advice", "locator": "/turns/0/text", "metadata_hash": "f25f47aea4897201db86b817228a9ac0648ccbb03f62840d5d38b504a91e6134", "published_at": "2025-03-23", "quote": "How to convince the seller to lower the asking price? It's common sense, every seller thinks that his property is the best and costs the most.", "source_hash": "dfca98da7f069d4b38f4e72feaf6ff393649b386ad04856eb828cb0bff0f83bd", "source_id": "youtube-shorts-run-transcripts-s46-yaml-bf8acc0e1a", "source_url": null, "speaker_id": "1", "statement": "Instead of being pushy and logical, come from a different perspective when convincing a seller to lower their asking price.", "time": "00:00:00", "title": "HOW TO CONVINCE THE SELLER", "topic": "sales strategy", "topic_slug": "sales-strategy", "unit_id": "youtube-shorts-run-transcripts-s46-yaml-bf8acc0e1a:u000001"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "context": "observed", "date_basis": "source", "external_id": "s46", "external_status": "not_checked", "id": "youtube-shorts-run-transcripts-s46-yaml-bf8acc0e1a:c001:e002:eb3c2b16", "kind": "observed_behavior", "locator": "/turns/1/text", "metadata_hash": "f25f47aea4897201db86b817228a9ac0648ccbb03f62840d5d38b504a91e6134", "published_at": "2025-03-23", "quote": "Let me ask you this. Who in your mind will be the person who will determine how much the property is actually worth?", "source_hash": "dfca98da7f069d4b38f4e72feaf6ff393649b386ad04856eb828cb0bff0f83bd", "source_id": "youtube-shorts-run-transcripts-s46-yaml-bf8acc0e1a", "source_url": null, "speaker_id": "1", "statement": "Asking questions and encouraging the seller to think about who determines the property's worth can lead to better engagement.", "time": "00:00:30", "title": "HOW TO CONVINCE THE SELLER", "topic": "communication skills", "topic_slug": "communication-skills", "unit_id": "youtube-shorts-run-transcripts-s46-yaml-bf8acc0e1a:u000002"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "context": "advised", "date_basis": "source", "external_id": "s46", "external_status": "not_checked", "id": "youtube-shorts-run-transcripts-s46-yaml-bf8acc0e1a:c001:e003:c87c04bf", "kind": "teaching_move", "locator": "/turns/2/text", "metadata_hash": "f25f47aea4897201db86b817228a9ac0648ccbb03f62840d5d38b504a91e6134", "published_at": "2025-03-23", "quote": "ask him this question and wait till he will tell you it's a buyer.", "source_hash": "dfca98da7f069d4b38f4e72feaf6ff393649b386ad04856eb828cb0bff0f83bd", "source_id": "youtube-shorts-run-transcripts-s46-yaml-bf8acc0e1a", "source_url": null, "speaker_id": "1", "statement": "Engaging the seller in a question-based dialogue allows them to realize the importance of buyer perception in determining property value.", "time": "00:00:38", "title": "HOW TO CONVINCE THE SELLER", "topic": "objection handling", "topic_slug": "objection-handling", "unit_id": "youtube-shorts-run-transcripts-s46-yaml-bf8acc0e1a:u000003"}
